# This directory stores all generated outputs.
# These files are excluded from version control (see .gitignore).
#
# Contents after running the full pipeline:
#
#   advanced_matches.csv        — Frame-to-album match rankings (Stage 4)
#   matches.csv                 — Basic CLIP-only match output (early version)
#   restore_log.csv             — Per-frame restoration status log (Stage 5)
#   Restored_Frames/            — Restored representative frame JPEGs (Stage 5)
#   Restored_Wedding_silent.mp4 — Reconstructed video without audio (Stage 6)
#   Restored_Wedding_final.mp4  — Final output with original audio (Stage 7)
#   comparison_side_by_side.mp4 — Optional side-by-side quality comparison
